# Database Rules

- Schema lives in `convex/schema.ts`
- Required tables: users, stores, categories, products, orders, payments, settings
- Add `createdAt` and `updatedAt` on every document
- Use indexes for lookup paths (email, slug, storeId, orderId)
- Status strings are validated against settings — not hardcoded unions in schema

# Forbidden

- No business logic in schema definitions
- No denormalized copies without a documented reason
